== Conflation ==

The same as Toronto's; see [[Toronto/Import/AddressPoints#Conflation|Toronto § Conflation]]. In short: '''MATCH''' when OSM has the same number and street within 15 m; '''MATCH_FAR''' (15–100 m), always reviewed by a person; '''MISSING''' otherwise. Pure address nodes and address-bearing polygons are match targets, POIs are not.

Thunder Bay specifics:

* The street name is matched on the City's <code>ROOT</code> (<code>BAILEY AVE</code>), expanded the same way on both sides.
* '''14 numbers carry a unit after a hyphen''' (<code>270-1</code> … <code>276-4</code>, three townhouse blocks on Caribou Crescent). They are split: <code>addr:housenumber=270</code> + <code>addr:unit=1</code>, one node per door. The City places each unit about 6 m apart.
* Duplicates within the source (same number and street within 3 m) are flagged for review.

== Workflow and QA ==

The same pipeline, checks, review queue, audit log and upload manifest as [[Toronto/Import/AddressPoints#Workflow and QA|Toronto]]. Checks enabled for Thunder Bay: <code>match_far</code>, <code>city_duplicate</code>, <code>missing_sample</code> (every 50th MISSING is reviewed by hand), <code>nearby_street_mismatch</code>. No <code>suffix_range</code>: the source has no ranges. An upload manifest (source row → OSM node → changeset) is published per tile.

== Risks and mitigations ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Risk !! Mitigation
|-
| New points alongside CanVec ranges describing the same block || Expected and temporary; the ranges are retired afterwards line by line by mappers, through [https://github.com/skfd/against-interpolation against-interpolation] ([[#CanVec interpolation|§ CanVec interpolation]]).
|-
| A standalone address already in OSM in another spelling || <code>nearby_street_mismatch</code> surfaces spelling variants; the pilot is reviewed by hand.
|-
| Adding addresses a First Nation did not want added || Phase 3 is gated on the letter and wait above; no FWFN address is ever in a City changeset.
|-
| An offensive street name copied from the source || Street names are reviewed per tile; "Squaw Bay Road" is held for the Nation's answer.
|-
| Community unaware || This page, the forum thread, local mappers contacted directly, and a run name in every changeset comment.
|}

== Revert plan ==

As [[Toronto/Import/AddressPoints#Revert plan|Toronto's]]: one changeset per run, tagged, so any run can be reverted with the [[JOSM/Plugins/Reverter|JOSM Reverter]]. Uploads pause on any reasonable stop request from the forum thread, a local mapper or the Nation, within one business day. Good-faith reverts by local mappers are not contested.

